{"assets":[],"contentKind":"statement","contestId":"1578","diagnostics":[],"document":{"children":[{"attrs":{"level":1,"role":"title"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"H. Higher Order Functions"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"time_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"time limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"2 seconds"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"memory_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"memory limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"1024 megabytes"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"body"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Helen studies functional programming and she is fascinated with a concept of "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"higher order functions"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" — functions that are taking other functions as parameters. She decides to generalize the concept of the function "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"order"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" and to test it on some examples. "}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"For her study, she defines a simple grammar of types. In her grammar, a type non-terminal $$$T$$$ is defined as one of the following grammar productions, together with $$$\\textrm{order}(T)$$$, defining an order of the corresponding type:"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"attrs":{"ordered":false},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"()"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\" is a unit type, $$$\\textrm{order}(\\textrm{\"}\\texttt{()}\\textrm{\"}) = 0$$$."}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" \"(\" $$$T$$$ \")\" is a parenthesized type, $$$\\textrm{order}(\\textrm{\"}\\texttt{(}\\textrm{\"}\\,T\\,\\textrm{\"}\\texttt{)}\\textrm{\"}) = \\textrm{order}(T)$$$."}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" $$$T_1$$$ \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"->"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\" $$$T_2$$$ is a functional type, $$$\\textrm{order}(T_1\\,\\textrm{\"}\\texttt{- \\gt }\\textrm{\"}\\,T_2) = max(\\textrm{order}(T_1) + 1, \\textrm{order}(T_2))$$$. The function constructor $$$T_1$$$ \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"->"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\" $$$T_2$$$ is right-to-left associative, so the type \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"()->()->()"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\" is the same as the type \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"()->(()->())"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\" of a function returning a function, and it has an order of $$$1$$$. While \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"(()->())->()"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\" is a function that has an order-1 type \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"(()->())"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\" as a parameter, and it has an order of $$$2$$$. "}],"kind":"list_item"}],"kind":"list"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Helen asks for your help in writing a program that computes an order of the given type."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"input_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The single line of the input contains a string consisting of characters '"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"("}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"', '"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":")"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"', '"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"-"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"', and '"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":">"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"' that describes a type that is valid according to the grammar from the problem statement. The length of the line is at most $$$10^4$$$ characters."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"output_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Print a single integer — the order of the given type."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"samples"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Examples"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n()\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n0\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n()->()\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n1\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n()->()->()\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n1\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n(()->())->()\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"ch